Puzzle content notice

All 50 puzzles in apps/web/src/data/puzzles.json are Chinese translations and
adaptations of questions and accepted answers on Puzzling Stack Exchange.
The individual authors, question and answer links, and original post licenses
(CC BY-SA 3.0 or CC BY-SA 4.0) are recorded in
apps/web/src/data/puzzle-sources.json. Attribution belongs to those authors;
no endorsement is implied. Retrieved and adapted on 2026-10-15.

Changes: translated and condensed into Chinese, adjusted narrative details to
resolve ambiguity and contradictions, and added judgment points. These are
adaptations, not verbatim translations. Some titles and settings were changed.

